 [1CSeparately, the app's clock updates [1mevery 5 seconds[22m ([38;2;177;185;249museNow [min [38;2;177;185;249msrc/ui/hooks/useNow.ts:4[m). So the arrival estimates shown on screen are recalculated from the timetable already    [3;3Hloaded every 5 seconds, even though the timetable itself is only fetched again every 6 hours.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         [38;2;153;153;153m✻[1CCrunched for 8s · done 10:17 PM                                                                                                                                                   [m[6;3H                                                                                                                                                                                  [38;2;80;80;80m[48;2;55;55;55m❯ [38;2;255;255;255mbut the app label tells that timetable is from the current minute, why is it only read every 6 hours                                                                              [m
[K[38;2;153;153;153m[9;3HSearched for [1m1[22m pattern, read [1m2[22m files                                                                                                                                              [m[10;3H                                                                                                                                                                                  [38;2;255;255;255m●[m[1CThe label is telling you when the estimate was calculated, not when the timetable was fetched. The wording makes it easy[1Cto read it the second[1Cway.                                                                                                                                                                                                                   [1m[13;3HWhat the time in the label is.[22m In [38;2;177;185;249msrc/ui/sheet\NearestStopContent.tsx:53-54 [mthe note reads "Positions and times estimated from the timetable at {time}". That time comes from     [38;2;177;185;249m[14;3Happroaching[0].at[m, which is the moment the bus positions and countdowns were last worked out from the current clock. The clock updates every 5 seconds, so the time always shows  [15;3Hthe current minute.                                                                                                                                                               [16;3H                                                                                                                                                                                  [1m[17;3HWhy fetching every 6 hours is enough.[22m The data is Metro Mondego's published schedule: three static files of about 600 KB each, one per day type (weekdays, Saturday, Sunday). It   [1Chas no live information, so fetching[1Cit every minute[1Cwould just[1Cdownload the same schedule again. The[1Clive[1Cpart[1Cis the calculation: the app takes the current time[1Cand works[1Cout[19;3Hfrom the schedule where each bus should be and how long until it reaches your stop.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   [1m[21;3HA related quirk.[22m[1CThere[1Cis[1Ca[1Cseparate[1C"Timetable[1Cdata[1Cfrom[1C…[1Cmay[1Cbe[1Cout[1Cof[1Cdate"[1Cnote[1Cthat[1Cis[1Cmeant[1Cto[1Cshow[1Cwhen[1Cthe[1Cdata[1Cwas[1Cactually[1Cfetched.[1CThe[1Cbrowser[1Cusually[1Chides[1Cthe
 [1Cheader that fetch time is read from ([38;2;177;185;249mDate[m), so the code falls back to the current time. As a result, that note almost never appears                                                 ([38;2;177;185;249mdocumentation/modules/timetable-and-estimates.md:38-41[m).[K
